Privacy Policy

Last Updated: 16 February 2026

1. Introduction

Welcome to CarryOn Cinema ("the App").
Your privacy is important. This Privacy Policy explains what information is collected, used, or shared when you use the App.
CarryOn Cinema does not collect, store, transmit, or sell personal data.
The App is designed for users of all ages and complies with applicable privacy standards for general audiences.

2. Information We Collect

We do not collect any personal information.
Specifically:
No account registration
No names, emails, or phone numbers
No analytics tracking
No advertising identifiers
No location tracking
No background data collection
No behavioral tracking
No telemetry
The App operates locally on your device.

3. Media & Local Content

CarryOn Cinema is designed to:
Play media files stored locally
Connect to user-configured servers (if applicable)
Cache metadata locally for offline use
All media and metadata remain:
On your device
On your self-hosted server
Under your control
The App does not transmit your media library information to the developer or any third party.

4. Permissions

The App may request device permissions strictly for functionality purposes, such as:
Storage access (to read local media files)
Network access (to connect to user-configured servers or metadata providers)
These permissions are used only for core functionality and are never used for tracking or data collection.

5. Third-Party Services

CarryOn Cinema does not include:
Third-party advertising SDKs
Analytics SDKs
Tracking frameworks
Social media integrations
If the user chooses to enable metadata or subtitle fetching from external providers, those requests are made directly from the device to the selected provider according to that provider’s privacy policy.
The developer does not proxy, log, or store those requests.

6. Children’s Privacy

CarryOn Cinema is rated for all ages.
Because the App does not collect personal information, it complies with children’s privacy regulations such as:
COPPA (Children’s Online Privacy Protection Act)
GDPR (where applicable to personal data collection)
No personal data is knowingly collected from children or adults.

7. Data Security

Since no personal data is collected or transmitted:
There are no user databases
There are no user profiles
There is no centralized data storage
All data remains under user control.

8. Data Selling or Sharing

CarryOn Cinema:
Does not sell data
Does not share data
Does not monetize user information
There is no user data to sell or share.

9. Changes to This Policy

If this Privacy Policy changes, the updated version will be published in the app repository and/or app store listing with a revised "Last Updated" date.

